<Routine Name="R31_Exhaust_VFD" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[p12r31
This routine is called, continuously, from p12R01 Main while the plc is in Run mode.  All modes and fault reset requests are controlled, here.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[SBR()OTE(p12r31.comment.0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
