<![CDATA[OTE(p20r13.comment.1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Notes
Letoff accumulator postion control.
The carriage position in mm is compared to the control setpoint in mm.
A fixed range around the control setpoint moves with this setpoint.
If the carriage position is above the high range point, it will be driven down at high speed
If the carriage position is below the low range point, it will be driven up at high speed.
If the carriage position is inside the range, position is controlled by PID.
The control setpoint may be switched from a high position to a low position using the fill accumulator function.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(p20r13.comment.2);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
