</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Configure PID
The tension loadcell feedback is compared to its setpoint in a PID control.
With the PID output at 50%, error is made to be 0
Error is added or subtracted to the speed of the previous drive to calculate the required speed of the drive.
A gain factor is used to dampen the error effect on the drive speed.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(p22r10.comment.4);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
