<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Doff Position Mode

AUTO    - Winder A / Winder B doff PB indexes the turret to the preset
          doff position, shortest way round.
MANUAL  - the doff PBs do nothing.  The operator jogs the turret to
          whatever doff position suits, using turret fwd / rev.

Only the doff move is affected.  The Winder A / Winder B RUN position PBs
always index automatically, in both modes, and jog always works.

Selector is hmi_dint[0].22, freed when shortest path replaced the
mode_under direction override.

Rev 20260825 a29]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r09_ss_doff_auto)OTE(p29r09_mode_doff_auto);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
