<Rung Number="31" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Tension established band

Was hard coded +/-3 on winder A and +/-5 on winder B, so B declared tension
established on the looser criterion and reached state .6 - and therefore
started accumulator payout - sooner and at a wider tension error.

Both now use p29_param_tension_ok_band, one shared parameter, so they
cannot drift apart again.

Rev 20260825 a11]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CMP(p29_ai_wdr_lc<=(p01_recipe_active.winder_tension_sp+p29_param_tension_ok_band))CMP(p29_ai_wdr_lc>=(p01_recipe_active.winder_tension_sp-p29_param_tension_ok_band))OTE(p29r15_tension_ok);]]>
