<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[True web speed at the winder

Normally the web arrives at line speed.  While the accumulator is
paying out it also delivers acc_payout_fpm on top, and only torque mode
can use the correction - see the note above.

Rev 20260907 a47]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOV(p25_ao_selected_speed,p29r18_web_speed_at_winder);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r09_torque_mode)XIC(p00_wac.OUT_Acc_Payout)CPT(p29r18_web_speed_at_winder,p25_ao_selected_speed+p00_wac_payout_fpm);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(p29r16_request_run)XIC(p29_di_wdr_b_reset_core)[MOV(p29r18_selected_core_diameter,p29r18_winder_b_selected_diam_inch) ,MOV(p29r18_winder_b_selected_diam_inch,p29r18_winder_b_avg_diam_inch) ,MOV(p29r18_winder_b_selected_diam_inch,p29r18_winder_b_actual_diam_inch) ,MOV(p29r18_winder_b_selected_diam_inch,p29r18_winder_b_calc_diam_inch) ,FLL(p29r18_winder_b_selected_diam_inch,p29r18_winder_b_diam_avg_stack[0],1000) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r18_diameter_calc_active)XIO(p29r18_timer[1].DN)TON(p29r18_timer[1],?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Divisor guard - winder RPM

Diameter is back-calculated as line speed / winder RPM, so RPM is a
divisor - and it is live feedback from the drive, not a parameter.

diameter_calc_active only proves the winder is REQUESTED to run.  It
does not prove the shaft is turning.  A stall, a drive trip, or a lost
feedback word gives RPM = 0 while the calculation is still enabled,
which faults the processor.

Below 1 RPM the calculation is simply not performed and
calc_diam_inch holds its last good value.  That is better than
flooring the divisor, which would produce a huge diameter that the
LIM(1..30) stack filter would then have to reject.

Rev 20260904 a40]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r18_diameter_calc_active)GRT(p29_ai_wb_rpm,1.0)CPT(p29r18_winder_b_calc_diam_inch,p29r18_web_speed_at_winder*(12/1)*(1/3.14)*(p29_param_wb_gear_ratio/p29_ai_wb_rpm));]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[CMP(ABS(p29r11_tension_error)<=p01_param_tension_deviation) ,XIC(p29r09_torque_mode) ]XIO(p29_di_wdr_index_fwd)XIC(p29r18_diameter_calc_active)MOV(p29r18_winder_b_calc_diam_inch,p29r18_winder_b_actual_diam_inch);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r18_diameter_calc_active)LES(p29r18_winder_b_actual_diam_inch,p29r18_selected_core_diameter)MOV(p29r18_selected_core_diameter,p29r18_winder_b_actual_diam_inch);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r18_diameter_calc_active)LIM(1,p29r18_winder_b_actual_diam_inch,30)[XIC(p29r18_stack_ctrl.DN) FFU(p29r18_winder_b_diam_avg_stack[0],p29r18_winder_b_unload,p29r18_stack_ctrl,?,?) ,XIC(p29r18_timer[1].DN) FFL(p29r18_winder_b_actual_diam_inch,p29r18_winder_b_diam_avg_stack[0],p29r18_stack_ctrl,?,?) ,XIC(p29r18_stack_ctrl.DN) AVE(p29r18_winder_b_diam_avg_stack[0],0,p29r18_winder_b_avg_diam_inch,p29r18_ave_control,?,?) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r18_ave_control.ER)OTU(p29r18_ave_control.ER);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="19" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(p29r18_stack_ctrl.ER)OTU(p29r18_stack_ctrl.ER);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="20" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Output Control]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(p29r18.comment.5);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="21" Type="N">
<Comment>
